B.a1M=new A.an("What is SamadhanAI?","SamadhanAI is a digital experience for submitting public-service grievances and following their progress. It includes citizen workflows and tools for authorized case management.")
B.a1E=new A.an("What kinds of issues can I report?","You can describe a local public-service issue in the application. Available categories and any suggested department depend on the configured services and information you provide.")
B.a1i=new A.an("How can I follow my grievance?","After signing in, use My Grievances to view submitted cases and the status information available for each one.")
B.a1n=new A.an("How does AI assist with grievance management?","When the AI service is configured and available, it can help classify a complaint, suggest wording, or analyze submitted details. Review suggestions before submitting; AI output is not a decision or guarantee.")
B.a1G=new A.an("Do I need an account?","You need to sign in to submit a grievance or view your grievance history. You can explore this page without an account.")
B.a1p=new A.an(u.n,"SamadhanAI provides grievance-management workflows. This website does not claim that every report is connected to or automatically delivered to a government department. Assignment depends on the application configuration and authorized workflows.")
B.a1N=new A.an("What if a grievance cannot be assigned automatically?","The application may provide suggested classification where configured. Authorized personnel can review cases within their permissions; the platform does not promise automatic assignment or a response time.")
